{
  "id": "section-random-encounter",
  "document": "Alone Against Fear (Andrea Sfiligoi) (z-library.sk, 1lib.sk, z-lib.sk).pdf",
  "paragraphs": [
    {
      "id": "section-random-encounter:p0",
      "kind": "heading",
      "text": "Random encounter table (roll d6, then another d6)\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[39,22,72]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "section-random-encounter:p1",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "1\n1,2) Roll on the Slashers table. Reroll any slasher that you\nhave already defeated in the campaign. If all slashers have\nbeen defeated, treat as no encounter.\n3-6) Roll on the Witch Children table.\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[39,72,74],[39,74,135],[39,135,195],[39,195,233],[39,233,272]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "section-random-encounter:p2",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "2\n1-3) Roll on the Demonic Horror table.\n4-6) Roll on the Beasts table.\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[39,272,274],[39,274,313],[39,313,344]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "section-random-encounter:p3",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "3\n1,2) Roll on the Lab Horror table.\n3-5) Roll on the Undead table.\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[39,344,346],[39,346,381],[39,381,412]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "section-random-encounter:p4",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "6) Roll on the Unique Vampire table.\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[39,412,449]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "section-random-encounter:p5",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "4\n1-4) Roll on the Possessed table.\n5,6) Roll on the Living Dolls table.\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[39,449,451],[39,451,485],[39,485,522]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "section-random-encounter:p6",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "5\n1-5) Roll on the Ghosts table.\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[39,522,524],[39,524,555]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "section-random-encounter:p7",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "6) Roll on the Aliens table.\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[39,555,584]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "section-random-encounter:p8",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "6\n1-3) Roll on the Unique Vampire table.\n4-6) Roll on the Unique Zombie table. When rolling on\ntables of Unique creatures, reroll any monster that was\nalready killed. If all unique monsters have been killed,\ntreat as no encounter.\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[39,584,586],[39,586,625],[39,625,679],[39,679,735],[39,735,792],[39,792,815]]"
    }
  ],
  "sourcePages": [
    39
  ]
}
